            "review_title": "Review at Happy Light Restaurant",
            "review_text": "MalcolmRobyn L\nNha Trang, Vietnam48 contributions\n0\nStrange food (hardly Chiinese) - filled with tour groups\nFeb 2018 • Couples\nThis place had the strangest (supposedly Chinese) menu we have ever seen.\nObviously almost solely reserved for serving pre-paid tour groups.\nPrices high compared with other similar establishments.\nService very slap-dash. Couldn't even give us the right bill (and we only had two items)\nWE DO NOT RECOMMEND\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten February 21, 2018",
